# 基本表計算 (design 11.13), for tools/ui_run.py: the template opened with its
# 操作パネル over the window's top edge, values and formulas typed, a range
# made bold and a chart made from the panel, the chart copied and pasted, a
# formula put in with fx and the panel's box and ✓, words typed in the box
# through かな漢字変換, ✕, the window carried with the panel following it,
# the panel put away and brought back from the menu, saved, closed and
# opened again, and the sample sheet with its links and charts shown.
# The template's window is at 100,100 and its panel at 100,0 (its work area
# from 106,6): the panel's rows are at y 21, 48 and 75, the grid's first row
# at y 163.
open 019b54a4-6ccf-72f7-e320-c98e4a0bab4e
expect calc: ready
expect calc: panel at 100 0 712 96
wait 800
win 基本表計算
shot calc_panel_open
click 200 163
text 10
key 28
text 20
key 28
text =A1+A2*2
key 28
expect calc: set A3 shows 50
click 280 163
text abc
key 2B
text =SUM(A1:A3)
key 28
expect calc: set C1 shows 80
click 520 163
text A
key 28
text B
key 28
text C
key 28
click 600 163
text 1
key 28
text 3
key 28
text =F1+1
key 28
expect calc: set F3 shows 2
wait 300
shot calc_typed
# 太字 from the panel: its switch shows the cell's bold
wait 500
drag 200 163 200 207
click 263 21
expect calc: panel style.bold
wait 300
shot calc_panel_bold
# 集合縦棒
drag 520 163 600 207
click 514 48
expect calc: chart bar
key 06 01
expect calc: chart copied
key 19 01
expect calc: chart pasted
wait 500
shot calc_chart
# fx: the box begins with =, ✓ puts it in the cell and the cell in hand stays
click 440 163
click 182 75
expect calc: panel fx
text SUM(A1:A3)
wait 300
shot calc_panel_fx
click 660 75
expect calc: panel ok
expect calc: set D1 shows 80
wait 300
shot calc_panel_ok
# the box pressed: typed there through the system's かな漢字変換, Enter puts it in
click 440 185
click 406 75
key 88
text kana
expect calc: panel field
wait 300
shot calc_panel_kana
key 28
key 28
expect calc: set D2 shows かな
key 39
# ✕ leaves the cell as it was
click 440 207
click 182 75
text 99
click 692 75
expect calc: panel cancel
wait 300
shot calc_panel_cancel
# the window carried by its band: the panel goes with it
drag 500 112 560 162
wait 500
win 基本表計算
shot calc_panel_moved
drag 560 162 500 112
wait 300
# 表示 > 操作パネル表示オンオフ: away, and back
click 600 400 1
wait 400
move 610 461
wait 150
move 750 461
wait 300
shot calc_menu_view
click 750 461
expect calc: panel off
wait 300
shot calc_panel_off
click 600 400 1
wait 400
move 610 400
wait 150
move 750 400
wait 300
shot calc_menu_view2
click 750 400
expect calc: panel on
wait 300
key 16 01
expect calc: saved
key 08 01
expect calc: closed
open 019b54a4-6ccf-72f7-e320-c98e4a0bab4e
expect calc: ready 基本表計算 cells 13 charts 2
wait 800
shot calc_reopened
click 440 340
key 08 01
expect calc: closed
open 019b15f8-72b8-7151-a57f-149fb1f59a17
expect calc: ready 基本表計算 cells 26 charts 2
wait 1000
move 800 450
wheel -5
wait 500
shot calc_sample
# nothing it did was refused for want of a right
absent !OACV!
